            <h2>Practical Notes &amp; Sunset</h2>

            <ul class="note-list">
              <li>Hills are steep; footwear and some base fitness matter.</li>
              <li>Churches are numerous and ornate, often with entry fees.</li>
              <li>Douro tours and port cellars are the standout experiences.</li>
              <li>Avoid obvious tourist-trap dining right on the main docks.</li>
              <li>
                Porto performs well across wine, architecture, scenery, and pricing.
              </li>
            </ul>

